  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 2.1.0: Automatic Conversation History Management\n\n✨ New Features:\n• Automatic session-based conversation management with persistent context\n• Intelligent conversation history storage across all providers (Redis, SQLite, FileSystem, InMemory)\n• New conversation commands (/new, /reset, /clear) for user control\n• Enhanced API with backward-compatible session management\n\n🔧 Technical Improvements:\n• Fixed conversation format consistency across all storage providers\n• Improved thread safety and error handling for conversation operations\n• Platform-agnostic design maintains compatibility with all .NET environments\n\n📚 Documentation Updates:\n• Updated all language versions (EN, TR, DE, RU)\n• Real examples aligned with actual codebase\n• API reference updated with new signatures\n\n🎯 Compliance:\n• 100% compliance with all established rules\n• Zero warnings policy maintained\n• SOLID and DRY principles applied",
  "repository": "",
